### GET IMAGES

### Get Image by ID
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images/1

###

### Get All Images
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images

###

### Get Images by Crop
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images/crop/1

###

### Get Images by Tracker
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images/tracker/1

###

### Get Images by User
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images/user/1

###

### Get Image by ID - Not Found
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images/9999

###

### Get Images by Crop - Empty Result
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images/crop/9999

###

### SERVE IMAGE FILE

### Get Image File via Direct URL (from response data.fileUrl)
GET {{SERVER}}/uploads/images/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890.jpg

###

### Get Image File via API Endpoint
GET {{SERVER}}/api/images/file/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890.jpg

###

### DELETE IMAGE


### Delete Image - Success
DELETE {{SERVER}}/api/images/1

###

### Delete Image - Not Found
DELETE {{SERVER}}/api/images/9999

